    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "SUPERB FOUR BEDROOM BUNGALOW FOR RENT IN A PEACEFUL LOCATION CLOSE TO ARVAGH, BALLINAGH AND CAVAN TOWN\n\nSmith Property are delighted to bring this superb, spacious four-bedroom bungalow to the rental market.\n\nSituated in a peaceful rural location of County Cavan, this property offers generous accommodation throughout.\nThe property enjoys a quiet setting while remaining within easy reach of Cavan Town and surrounding towns and villages.\n\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, four well-proportioned bedrooms, two ensuites, a large kitchen/dining room, separate sitting room, utility room and WC.\n\nThe large kitchen/dining room is a fantastic family space and features an open fireplace, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere. \nThe property also benefits from a separate sitting room, which features another open fireplace and attractive timber flooring.\n\nThe property has timber flooring throughout the majority of the accommodation, including the bedrooms and living areas, with tiled flooring in the kitchen and bathrooms.\n\nThe separate utility room provides valuable additional storage and practical space, while the WC adds further convenience.\nAvailable the start of October.\n\nTo Apply\n\n.\nInterested applicants are asked to visit the Smith Property website and complete the Tenancy Application Form, located in the Rental/Tenants section.\n\n\nPlease note that references are required before viewing. \nApplicants should have their current landlord reference available for submission with the application.\n"
      },
